{ "format": "xitdb-script/1", "description": "Finding 9, as Zig does it: a stream of a short value takes its length from the cursor and its bytes from the file. So once the slot has been overwritten, it gives neither value: 8 bytes of \"changed\", and 2 bytes of the new uint.", "hash_size": 20, "hash_id": "sha1", "file_id": "0011223344556677",
  "ops": [
